7. She was not trained to assist customers from Northern Ireland during her first office job, which caused a problem during a support call. (Verbatim: "I was only taught how to deal with the English customers... not people in Northern Ireland.")  
8. She became overwhelmed and nearly in tears during her first customer service call due to lack of training and the caller’s anger. (Verbatim: "I was there, like, almost in tears, okay? This was my first call.")  
